<section id="faq" class="card" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="faq-heading">Member management FAQs</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <h3 class="h5">Can members update their own information?</h3>
    <p>Yes. People can keep their own contact info, relationships, and custom fields current — leaders review rather than retype everything.</p>
    <h3 class="h5">How do teams and sub-teams work?</h3>
    <p>Create teams, nest sub-teams, and assign managers who can handle their slice — events, attendance, and announcements scoped to just that team.</p>
    <h3 class="h5">What about privacy for families and minors?</h3>
    <p>You control what each team can see. Sensitive fields stay with authorized managers; directory views respect team boundaries. See <a href="/faq/">full FAQ</a> for more on roles and data control.</p>
    <p class="mb-0"><a href="/faq/">All FAQs →</a> · <a href="/features/">Back to Features hub</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

